      "name": "Why Tinnitus Gets Worse",
      "char_file": "맥주_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Blood flow or fluid pressure",
        "in your inner ear shifts,",
        "and your brain fills in the sound",
        "",
        "Alcohol, caffeine, and sodium",
        "can all throw that off at once"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Alcohol",
      "char_file": "맥주_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "It dilates blood vessels,",
        "then makes them rebound",
        "",
        "The diuretic effect drains fluid,",
        "unsettling your inner ear too"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Alcohol — What Helps",
      "char_file": "맥주_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Match every drink with water",
        "to ease the fluid swings",
        "",
        "It softens the rebound",
        "that follows a night out"
      ]
    },
